- Tests added: six duplicate identity/strategy cases; inactive target/active duplicate; source namespace independence. Existing same-property-ID cases retained.
- Test results: focused exclusion plus valuation service: **46 passed**. Synthetic target uses ID 1130; actual Oracle target not yet validated after correction.
- Oracle compatibility: FAILED baseline; request field absent. Local code requires deployment.
- Deployment: NOT DEPLOYED; safe additive Python change, no migration or extra services. Deployment gates still pending.
